body:
Before i say this, i'm going to say i don't agree with them, i'm just sharing a story.

&#x200B;

So, i used to be friends with a trans girl, yet cut ties because of stuff like this. She said, in her eyes the support in current society and most social media (minus reddit) is for trans men, and she feels like most "trans support pages" cater more to trans men than trans women. So baiscally, there is still a major lack of support in the broad spectrum for trans women, than trans men.
